cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in published work, please cite it as below."
title: "EPICS PV MCP Server"
abstract: >-
  A read-only Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that gives an AI assistant
  diagnosable access to an EPICS control system: live process-variable values
  over PVAccess and Channel Access, connection diagnosis with a per-plane
  explanation, and cross-plane provenance joining ChannelFinder, the EPICS
  Archiver Appliance, the Phoebus Alarm Logger, a naming service, the Phoebus
  Olog logbook and CS-Studio operator screens. Mutating operations sit behind
  independent, audited gates that are disabled by default.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nordt
    given-names: Dirk
    alias: epicDirk
repository-code: "https://github.com/epicDirk/EPICS-MCP-Server"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - EPICS
  - control systems
  - Model Context Protocol
  - MCP
  - accelerator
  - scientific computing
  - PVAccess
  - Channel Access
# version and date-released are deliberately absent until the first proper release carries a
